<h3><bookmark content=" 3. Industry Overview:" level="1" /><a name="teasersmillennium_education_foundation__industry_overview">3. Industry Overview:</a></h3>
<div class="level3">

<p>
The Indian education sector has experienced remarkable growth, with literacy rates rising from 18% in 1951 to 81.3% in 2023. The country now boasts over 1,000 universities and more than 42,000 colleges. The edtech market in India is expected to reach $30 billion by 2031, with the online education market projected to grow by 23.06% between 2024 and 2029. citeturn0search7
</p>

